rounds.text:
A calm banking palette can be built on a deep, desaturated navy primary, a slate-teal secondary for supporting elements, and a soft sky accent used sparingly. The primary's tonal range runs from a pale wash to deep navy, for backgrounds, borders and text. The three text pairings below are the ones to check against the AA contrast floors.

